WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.090 --> 00:00:03.610
A family is choosing a baby monitor.

2
00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:07.370
They have a few must-haves,
so they ask an AI assistant.

3
00:00:10.457 --> 00:00:12.537
It can't test a single monitor.

4
00:00:12.677 --> 00:00:16.497
It can only read: twenty-two
web sources for every question.

5
00:00:17.528 --> 00:00:20.128
One of those pages belongs to a seller.

6
00:00:20.428 --> 00:00:23.548
And it's honest: this
camera needs a subscription.

7
00:00:24.474 --> 00:00:26.374
Now the seller rewrites it.

8
00:00:26.434 --> 00:00:27.514
Same monitor.

9
00:00:27.634 --> 00:00:28.514
Same price.

10
00:00:28.894 --> 00:00:30.314
Only the words change.

11
00:00:30.922 --> 00:00:32.582
The limitation vanishes.

12
00:00:32.842 --> 00:00:35.322
A checklist says the requirement is met.

13
00:00:35.502 --> 00:00:37.462
The page calls itself independent.

14
00:00:38.639 --> 00:00:43.959
In one run we recorded, the honest page
left this monitor tenth out of nineteen.

15
00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:46.520 position:56% size:88% align:center
The rewritten page put it first.

16
00:00:48.326 --> 00:00:50.046 position:56% size:88% align:center
One defence helps most:

17
00:00:50.206 --> 00:00:54.386 position:56% size:88% align:center
check the key claims against evidence
for and against, before ranking.

18
00:00:55.043 --> 00:00:58.443
It narrows the gap by eighteen
to thirty-nine points.

19
00:00:58.583 --> 00:00:59.783
It doesn't close it.

20
00:01:00.759 --> 00:01:03.179
SafeGEO is a paper from
Humanity's Last Choice,

21
00:01:03.219 --> 00:01:07.759
an open research community
studying how AI chooses for people.

22
00:01:08.713 --> 00:01:09.793
Read the paper.

23
00:01:10.173 --> 00:01:11.513
Explore the benchmark.

24
00:01:11.853 --> 00:01:13.513 line:77% position:50% size:92% align:center
Help us build the community.
